## 1. Verdict

M0–M7, X1 and the §9.x extras are implemented and verified working. Every open
issue from the previous audit is closed.

Two rounds of work sit behind that sentence:

- **Audit round:** 12 defects found, 3 of them fatal on a fresh install (agent
  panicked at startup, every UI mutation returned 403, no server could be
  attached). All fixed. See §3.
- **Follow-up round:** closing the audit's eight open issues surfaced **10 more
  defects**, six of which meant a documented feature could not work at all
  (import impossible, backup listing always empty, "sync from node" a no-op that
  reported success). All fixed. See §4.

The pattern across both rounds: the code existed and compiled, but nothing had
exercised it. Every defect was in a path with no test touching it.

