| 5 | P1 | With 2FA on, login was impossible; a session was created before the second factor; TOTP guesses unthrottled | split `verify_credentials`/`start_session`, unified two-stage login, signed 5-minute challenge, throttled |
| 6 | P1 | Plugin/theme/user/cron/backup lists and log tails all failed at runtime | internally-tagged newtype variants wrapping `Vec` cannot serialise; variants now carry named fields + round-trip test over every variant |
| 7 | P1 | Clone form always returned 422 | `bool` cannot deserialise an HTML checkbox; `Option<String>` + `checked()` |
| 8 | P1 | Staging sites stayed `provisioning` forever | `apply_effects` now handles `StagingCreate` and resolves `target_site_id` |
| 9 | P1 | JSON API leaked every site, server and job to any authenticated user | all six handlers scope to the caller |
| 10 | P2 | Agent logged WordPress, restic and MySQL passwords in cleartext | `exec::redact_command` + 5 tests, verified against a live log |
| 11 | P2 | `.env.example` missing 8 variables incl. `WP_PANEL_SECRET_KEY` | added, with a warning about losing the key |
| 12 | P2 | `docs/PROTOCOL.md` missing `core_check_update` | documented |

